  "body": "Waveshare 0.1.55 wifi-footer repair\n\nPreserved common Home default.elf SHA256 9f10c7150cdc175ff5af0dbc1410e455ead4f18868dd56555e10860781103f2f.\nFix Wi-Fi Prev, Select and Next touch coordinates at native-height Watch resolutions; preserve scan/cancel and Back behavior.\nRetain the .54 no-host serial sleep repair, power and panel repairs, Home, Settings, Springboard and every other application/provider ELF byte-for-byte. Only Wi-Fi 1.1.34 and its versioned manifest change alongside cohort identity.\nNative ESP-IDF 6.1 / GCC 15.2 Runtime with generic file and settings providers.\nRTEF1 serial individual-file transfers use writable private namespace 2; Waveshare also admits writable SD namespace 12.\nSerial writes never target the active boot bank. Replace is explicit and not atomic; interrupted writes can remain partial.\nNative faces and the alarm repair are retained. All 125 unrelated store payloads, including 61 ELF files, are byte-identical.\nSoftware-qualified; hardware has not been tested for this release.\nThe factory image erases existing device data. Back up first. No data-preserving update kit is supplied.\nDo not flash standalone firmware/store files independently; their bank binding must remain paired.\n"
